## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical debugging of network policies and safe rollback in a novice-friendly way. It emphasizes isolating networking changes, validating through pod-level checks, and ensuring performance targets during recovery.

## Key Concepts
- Kubernetes NetworkPolicy egress rules
- In-cluster vs external services
- kubectl exploration and testing
- Zero-downtime rollback and load testing
- Latency targets (P95) during recovery

